<headroom-library version="1" id="hg-crossover-riot" category="High Gain" order="60" instrument="guitar" style="Crossover">
  <description>Crossover thrash rhythm: a gate, an overdrive at low drive and full level pushing a British 100-watt master-volume head with the mids up, into a 4x12, bone dry. Raw, punchy and fast; it stays tight on blast-speed downpicking and crunchy rather than fizzy.</description>
